					"defUid": 128,
					"realEditorValues": [null]
				},
				{
					"__identifier": "notes",
					"__type": "Multilines",
					"__value": "L4 teaching strip (novice playtest: aims were never discovered). A: Seize the furnace, throw the slab on the plate to open the gate (the bag is empty again). B: the only pink is a bar 3 tiles overhead: jump + Up+Seize, then Levy at the 6-tile wall for a spring (a brown crate + jump can't clear it). C: over the pit the far ledge is 8 tiles up: jump off the plateau and Down+Levy a spring under your feet mid-air (a forward throw lands in the pit; the pit is 4 deep so a feather jump climbs back out, and a spring on the pit floor can be seized back on foot).",
					"__tile": null,
					"defUid": 129,
					"realEditorValues": [
						{
							"id": "V_String",
							"params": [
								"L4 teaching strip (novice playtest: aims were never discovered). A: Seize the furnace, throw the slab on the plate to open the gate (the bag is empty again). B: the only pink is a bar 3 tiles overhead: jump + Up+Seize, then Levy at the 6-tile wall for a spring (a brown crate + jump can't clear it). C: over the pit the far ledge is 8 tiles up: jump off the plateau and Down+Levy a spring under your feet mid-air (a forward throw lands in the pit; the pit is 4 deep so a feather jump climbs back out, and a spring on the pit floor can be seized back on foot)."
							]
						}
					]
				}
			],
